  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">(66 fotos) L&#39;escriptor d&#39;Onda Salvador Belenguer Dol&ccedil; ha presentat aquest divendres la seua primera novel&middot;la,&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">L&rsquo;abra&ccedil;ada necess&agrave;ria</em><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">, amb la qual va guanyar&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">el Certamen Literari Ciutat de Vila-real de 2017.</span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllibresalvabelenguer/img_4559.jpg\" alt=\"img_4559\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllibresalvabelenguer/img_4561.jpg\" alt=\"img_4561\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllibresalvabelenguer/img_4562.jpg\" alt=\"img_4562\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllibresalvabelenguer/img_4563.jpg\" alt=\"img_4563\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllibresalvabelenguer/img_4564.jpg\" alt=\"img_4564\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllibresalvabelenguer/img_4566.jpg\" alt=\"img_4566\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllibresalvabelenguer/img_4570.jpg\" alt=\"img_4570\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenllibresalvabelenguer/img_4571.jpg\" alt=\"img_4571\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;